ween tMacs and LCs obtained from CellChat analysis. Supplementary Table 3. Sequences of sgRNA and shRNA. Supplementary Table 4. Antibodies used for immunofluorescence, flow cytometry and western blots. Supplementary Table 5. Primers information for quantitative PCR with reverse transcription. Supplementary Table 6. Light microscopy reporting table.</p></div></div><div class="c-article-supplementary__item" data-test="supp-item" id="MOESM7"><h3 class="c-article-supplementary__title u-h3"><a data-test="supp-info-link" class="print-link" data-track="call_to_action" data-track-action="view supplementary info" data-track-context="Supplementary information" data-track-label="supplementary data 1" href="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41556-026-01896-x/MediaObjects/41556_2026_1896_MOESM7_ESM.xlsx" data-supp-info-image="">Supplementary Data 1 (download XLSX <svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-download-medium"></use></svg>)</a></h3><div class="c-article-supplementary__description" data-component="thumbnail-container"><p>Source data for Supplementary Figures.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-title="Source data"><div class="c-article-section" id="Sec50-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="Sec50">Source data</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="Sec50-content"><div data-test="supplementary-info"><div class="c-article-supplementary__item" data-test="supp-item" id="MOESM8"><h3 class="c-article-supplementary__title u-h3"><a data-test="supp-info-link" class="print-link" data-track="call_to_action" data-track-action="view supplementary info" data-track-context="Source data" data-track-label="source data figs. 1–8 and extended data fig. 1–10" href="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41556-026-01896-x/MediaObjects/41556_2026_1896_MOESM8_ESM.xlsx" data-supp-info-image="">Source Data Figs. 1–8 and Extended Data Fig. 1–10 (download XLSX <svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-download-medium"></use></svg>)</a></h3><div class="c-article-supplementary__description" data-component="thumbnail-container"><p>Statistical source data.</p></div></div><div class="c-article-supplementary__item" data-test="supp-item" id="MOESM9"><h3 class="c-article-supplementary__title u-h3"><a data-test="supp-info-link" class="print-link" data-track="call_to_action" data-track-action="view supplementary info" data-track-context="Source data" data-track-label="source data extended data fig. 4" href="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41556-026-01896-x/MediaObjects/41556_2026_1896_MOESM9_ESM.pdf" data-supp-info-image="">Source Data Extended Data Fig. 4 (download PDF <svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-download-medium"></use></svg>)</a></h3><div class="c-article-supplementary__description" data-component="thumbnail-container"><p>Unprocessed western blots and gels.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-title="Rights and permissions"><div class="c-article-section" id="rightslink-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="rightslink">Rights and permissions</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="rightslink-content">
